node_modules/
# Single package manager: this repo uses npm (CI runs `npm ci`, Vercel builds from package-lock.json).
# A committed pnpm-lock.yaml would make Vercel silently switch to pnpm — keep it out of the tree.
pnpm-lock.yaml
# P1 production DB diagnostic outputs — contain prod schema inventory / DB identity. Never commit.
